## Program Outcome

Tool Shed website and dashboard changes are developed and proven on a private, production-like
site before intentional public promotion. The development stack is isolated from production on
the shared `sup.local` Docker host, is reachable only from approved LAN clients and a Workpc
localhost tunnel, communicates continuously with dedicated Linux and Windows development project
identities, and supports exact-commit promotion with recovery evidence across explicit web,
Windows-installation, and Linux-installation delivery lanes from one canonical source.

