## M3-PROMOTION-AND-RECOVERY-PROOF — Prove the public promotion path

Status: in-progress
Required Endpoint: Work5 for one explicitly selected development-tested commit
Depends on: M1-ISOLATED-PRIVATE-DEVELOPMENT, M2-DEVELOPMENT-COMMUNICATION

Outcome: Implement and prove project-only lane enforcement without changing portable work-level
definitions; prove migrations and recovery on non-production data; pass login, MFA, dashboard,
enrollment, Workpc, and required web/Windows/Linux lane checks; confirm development has no public
route; back up production before any migration-bearing promotion; promote the exact tested commit;
and verify production health, released installations, parent reconciliation, and a practical
rollback path.

Gate:

- `G4-PROMOTION-RECOVERY`

Candidate campaign: `qualify-and-promote-development-tested-commit`.

Execution boundary: this roadmap authorizes the local project-specific validator and configuration
